{#- You've been nominated (to the nominee) · Nominations.
    Senders: NomineeConfirmation::ask (with confirm_url — the nominee confirms it is them),
             NominationAftercare::email (without — the panel checks it first).
    Variables: programme, first_name, quote, quote_by, confirm_url, confirm_days, watch_url, help_url.
    Design: Email Templates.dc.html → "You've been nominated", corrected to the live site
    (owner, 19 Oct 2026): `quote_by` never names a nominator who asked to stay private
    (nominator_private); "reply to this email" is the help desk, which a person reads; and
    the path without a confirm link says what actually happens next. -#}
{% extends 'emails/_layout.html.twig' %}
{% block category %}Nominations{% endblock %}
{% block hero %}illo-gift{% endblock %}
{% block why %}Somebody nominated you for an Africa GATES award.{% endblock %}
{% block subject %}You’ve been nominated — Africa GATES{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}{{ quote_by ? quote_by ~ ' nominated you' : 'Somebody nominated you' }}{{ programme ? ' for ' ~ programme : '' }}.{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
{%- import 'emails/_blocks.html.twig' as b -%}
{% if programme %}{{ b.eyebrow(programme) }}{% endif %}
{{ b.h1("#{first_name}, someone thinks you deserve to be celebrated") }}
{% if quote %}{{ b.quote(quote, quote_by ?: 'Someone who knows your work') }}{% endif %}
{% if confirm_url %}
{{ b.p('Confirm it’s you and that you are happy to be nominated. Then you can tell the judges about your work in your own words.') }}
{{ b.button('Confirm and continue', confirm_url) }}
{{ b.note("The link works for #{confirm_days} days. Nothing here costs money. Not you, or you’d rather not take part? Open the link and say no.") }}
{% else %}
{{ b.p('A reviewer checks every nomination before it joins the award. If yours is approved, we will email you an invitation to tell the judges about your work in your own words.') }}
{{ b.button('See the award', watch_url) }}
{{ b.note('Nothing here costs money. Not you, or you’d rather not take part? Tell us through the help desk and we’ll remove it.') }}
{{ b.link('Tell us through the help desk', help_url) }}
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
